 {
  "id": "top_k_words",
  "function": "top_k_words",
  "spec": "top_k_words(text, k) returns the k most frequent words as a list of [word, count] lists. Lowercase the text. A word is a maximal run of the characters a-z and the apostrophe ('); every other character separates words. Strip apostrophes from both ends of each word, and drop words that become empty. Sort by count descending, then by word ascending (alphabetical). If there are fewer than k distinct words return all of them. k = 0 gives an empty list.",
  "examples": [
   "top_k_words('a b a', 2) == [['a', 2], ['b', 1]]",
   "top_k_words('Hi hi.', 1) == [['hi', 2]]"
  ],
  "gate": [
   {
    "args": [
     "a b a",
     1
    ],
    "expect": [
     [
      "a",
      2
     ]
    ]
   },
   {
    "args": [
     "The the THE cat",
     2
    ],
    "expect": [
     [
      "the",
      3
     ],
     [
      "cat",
      1
     ]
    ]
   },
   {
